[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:The French Test]
[00:00.86]Lesson 103 | 第103课
[00:02.91]The French test | 法语考试
[00:06.02]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:12.16]How long did the exam last? | 考试持续了多长时间？
[00:16.82]How was the exam, Richard? | 考试怎么样，理查德？
[00:20.52]Not too bad. | 不太糟。
[00:22.36]I think I passed in English and Mathematics. | 我想我英语和数学都及格了。
[00:27.03]The questions were very easy. | 题目很简单。
[00:30.12]How about you, Gary? | 你怎么样，加里？
[00:32.76]The English and Maths papers weren't easy enough for me. | 英语和数学试卷对我来说都不够简单。
[00:39.61]I hope I haven't failed. | 我希望我没考砸。
[00:42.34]I think I failed the French paper. | 我想我法语没及格。
[00:46.08]I could answer sixteen of the questions. | 我能回答十六道题。
[00:50.26]They were very easy. | 它们很简单。
[00:52.80]But I couldn't answer the rest. | 但我回答不了剩下的题。
[00:56.08]They were too difficult for me. | 它们对我来说太难了。
[00:59.79]French tests are awful, aren't they? | 法语考试糟透了，不是吗？
[01:03.63]I hate them. | 我讨厌它们。
[01:05.42]I'm sure I've got a low mark. | 我肯定我得了低分。
[01:09.02]Oh, cheer up! | 哦，振作起来！
[01:12.42]Perhaps we didn't do too badly. | 也许我们考得没那么糟。
[01:16.54]The guy next to me wrote his name at the top of the paper. | 我旁边那个家伙在试卷顶部写了他的名字。
[01:22.25]Yes? | 然后呢？
[01:23.60]Then he sat there and looked at it for three hours! | 然后他坐在那里看了三个小时！
[01:28.95]He didn't write a word! | 他一个字也没写！